OL,3,GNEWSAFuel leak clean-up to enter next
OL,4,Aphase in autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next phase of work to clear up a
OL,7,Ffuel leak that contaminated a village's
OL,8,Fwater supply is due to start in the
OL,9,Fautumn.
OL,11,FIn May 2024, more than 600 homes in
OL,12,FBramley in Surrey were told not to
OL,13,Fdrink tap water for five weeks
OL,14,Ffollowing the fuel leak from an Asda
OL,15,Fpetrol station.
OL,17,FAsda now says there is no floating fuel
OL,18,Fin any borehole in the village and the
OL,19,Fnext phase of work will include
OL,20,Ftargeted injection of
OL,21,Fhydrocarbon-reducing compounds.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
